@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram for Ott Based System Mini Reel

state Start
state LoggedOut
state AccountCreation
state IncorrectDetails
state SignIn
state WatchVideos
state UploadVideo
state SaveVideo
state ViewSavedVideos
state EnterDiscussion

AccountCreation --> IncorrectDetails: Incorrect Details
IncorrectDetails --> AccountCreation: Retry

Start --> LoggedOut: Login/SignUp
LoggedOut --> AccountCreation: New Account
LoggedOut --> SignIn: Existing Account

SignIn --> WatchVideos: Successful Login
WatchVideos --> UploadVideo: Upload Video
UploadVideo --> SaveVideo: Save to Likes List
SaveVideo --> ViewSavedVideos: View Saved Videos
ViewSavedVideos --> EnterDiscussion: Enter Discussion Option
EnterDiscussion --> WatchVideos: Continue Watching

WatchVideos --> NewCase: Add a New Case
NewCase --> CaseCategorySelection: Select Category
CaseCategorySelection --> CaseDetailsEntry: Enter Details
CaseDetailsEntry --> SetReminder: Set Reminders
SetReminder --> UploadDocuments: Upload Related Documents
UploadDocuments --> WatchVideos: Continue Watching

LoggedOut --> [*]: End of Session
@enduml
